# Odd or Even Checker

A simple C++ program that determines whether a given integer is odd or even.

## Course
COS 201/CSC 207 — Lecture Assignment

## How It Works
The program reads an integer from the user and uses the modulo operator (`%`) 
to check the remainder when divided by 2:
- Remainder `0` → even
- Remainder `1` → odd

## Build & Run

```bash
g++ odd_even.cpp -o odd_even
./odd_even
